<title>POLAND: Polish shares end lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sixteen stocks fell and five stayed flat in 25.4-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Friday.</p>
<p>One stock did not trade.</p>
<p>The WIG 20 index ended at 1,870.2 points, 0.7 percent lower than at the regular session.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 2.7 percent in a 27-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
